{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MDSP632TDAgsY85MpscrFm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JTLgrU3FWVEtkawbeKmXwR","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista-expanded-visualization/.vista/ralph/share-docs-v2-build/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md","old_string":"## Phase 2: Specs and Implementation Plans from Ralph Jobs\n\n**Priority: HIGH** — Export artifacts from standalone Ralph jobs (`.vista/ralph/` directories).\n\n### Steps:\n- 2a. Add `get_exportable_ralph_jobs(project_path)` static method to ExportService — scans `.vista/ralph/` for jobs with exportable plans/progress/task/specs\n- 2b. Add `read_ralph_artifact(project_path, job_slug_dir, filename)` helper with path traversal prevention\n- 2c. Add `ExportRalphJobSelection` model and `ralph_jobs` field to `ExportRequest`\n- 2d. Add `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/ralph-jobs` endpoint\n- 2e. Extend `generate_export_html()` to accept and render Ralph job data\n- 2f. Add Ralph section to `export.html` template (after features)\n- 2g. Add Ralph jobs to export modal tree in `project.html`\n- 2h. Add 5 tests for Ralph job export","new_string":"## DONE: Phase 2 — Specs and Implementation Plans from Ralph Jobs\n\nAll sub-tasks completed in iteration 2:\n\n- **2a.** Added `get_exportable_ralph_jobs()` — scans `.vista/ralph/` for jobs with task.md, IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md, or progress.txt. Reads job.json for metadata (mode, status).\n- **2b.** Added `read_ralph_artifact()` with whitelist (RALPH_EXPORTABLE_FILES) and path traversal prevention on job_slug.\n- **2c.** Added `ExportRalphJobSelection` model with slug, include_task, include_plan, include_progress toggles. Added `ralph_jobs` field to `ExportRequest`.\n- **2d.** Added `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/ralph-jobs` endpoint.\n- **2e.** Extended `generate_export_html()` with `selected_ralph_jobs` parameter. Populates ralph_tasks, ralph_plans, ralph_progress in export_data.\n- **2f.** Added Ralph Jobs section to `export.html` with Task, Implementation Plan, and Progress Log subsections. Updated nav and renderAllMarkdown().\n- **2g.** Updated export modal in `project.html` — parallel fetch of features + ralph-jobs, Ralph Jobs tree section with per-artifact checkboxes, collectSelectedRalphJobs(), updated selectAll/download logic.\n- **2h.** Added 12 new tests (35 total, all passing) in TestExportableRalphJobs and TestExportRalphRoutes."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":986,"cache_read_input_tokens":100428,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":986},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7816649e-26fc-4938-9512-2c8c95fbe878","uuid":"c29762b8-a9f8-4f4c-ab33-05af8439f56c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JTLgrU3FWVEtkawbeKmXwR","type":"tool_result","content":"The file C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista-expanded-visualization/.vista/ralph/share-docs-v2-build/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7816649e-26fc-4938-9512-2c8c95fbe878","uuid":"41df3998-0d90-4669-b2d3-ef1fcca83375","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista-expanded-visualization/.vista/ralph/share-docs-v2-build/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md","oldString":"## Phase 2: Specs and Implementation Plans from Ralph Jobs\n\n**Priority: HIGH** — Export artifacts from standalone Ralph jobs (`.vista/ralph/` directories).\n\n### Steps:\n- 2a. Add `get_exportable_ralph_jobs(project_path)` static method to ExportService — scans `.vista/ralph/` for jobs with exportable plans/progress/task/specs\n- 2b. Add `read_ralph_artifact(project_path, job_slug_dir, filename)` helper with path traversal prevention\n- 2c. Add `ExportRalphJobSelection` model and `ralph_jobs` field to `ExportRequest`\n- 2d. Add `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/ralph-jobs` endpoint\n- 2e. Extend `generate_export_html()` to accept and render Ralph job data\n- 2f. Add Ralph section to `export.html` template (after features)\n- 2g. Add Ralph jobs to export modal tree in `project.html`\n- 2h. Add 5 tests for Ralph job export","newString":"## DONE: Phase 2 — Specs and Implementation Plans from Ralph Jobs\n\nAll sub-tasks completed in iteration 2:\n\n- **2a.** Added `get_exportable_ralph_jobs()` — scans `.vista/ralph/` for jobs with task.md, IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md, or progress.txt. Reads job.json for metadata (mode, status).\n- **2b.** Added `read_ralph_artifact()` with whitelist (RALPH_EXPORTABLE_FILES) and path traversal prevention on job_slug.\n- **2c.** Added `ExportRalphJobSelection` model with slug, include_task, include_plan, include_progress toggles. Added `ralph_jobs` field to `ExportRequest`.\n- **2d.** Added `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/ralph-jobs` endpoint.\n- **2e.** Extended `generate_export_html()` with `selected_ralph_jobs` parameter. Populates ralph_tasks, ralph_plans, ralph_progress in export_data.\n- **2f.** Added Ralph Jobs section to `export.html` with Task, Implementation Plan, and Progress Log subsections. Updated nav and renderAllMarkdown().\n- **2g.** Updated export modal in `project.html` — parallel fetch of features + ralph-jobs, Ralph Jobs tree section with per-artifact checkboxes, collectSelectedRalphJobs(), updated selectAll/download logic.\n- **2h.** Added 12 new tests (35 total, all passing) in TestExportableRalphJobs and TestExportRalphRoutes.","originalFile":"# Implementation Plan: Share Docs V2 Build\n\nBased on the plan from `.vista/ralph/share-docs-v2-plan-6556ab4b-1235-428b-b9d2-da3c725732ac/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`.\n\n## DONE: Phase 1 — Progress File & Planning Artifacts Export\n\nAll sub-tasks completed in iteration 1:\n\n- **1a.** Extended `get_exportable_features()` with `has_progress`, `has_agents_md`, `has_implementation_plan` flags\n- **1b.** Extended `generate_export_html()` to collect and pass new content types (progress, agents, implementation_plan) with toggle support\n- **1c.** Updated `ExportFeatureSelection` model with `include_requirements`, `include_progress`, `include_agents`, `include_implementation_plan` optional boolean fields (backward compatible, all default `True`)\n- **1d.** Extended `export.html` template with Implementation Plan, Progress Log, and Agents sections. Renamed `renderAllRequirements()` to `renderAllMarkdown()`.\n- **1e.** Updated export modal tree in `project.html` with indicator badges and per-content-type checkboxes\n- **1f.** Added 7 new tests (23 total, all passing)\n\n## Phase 2: Specs and Implementation Plans from Ralph Jobs\n\n**Priority: HIGH** — Export artifacts from standalone Ralph jobs (`.vista/ralph/` directories).\n\n### Steps:\n- 2a. Add `get_exportable_ralph_jobs(project_path)` static method to ExportService — scans `.vista/ralph/` for jobs with exportable plans/progress/task/specs\n- 2b. Add `read_ralph_artifact(project_path, job_slug_dir, filename)` helper with path traversal prevention\n- 2c. Add `ExportRalphJobSelection` model and `ralph_jobs` field to `ExportRequest`\n- 2d. Add `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/ralph-jobs` endpoint\n- 2e. Extend `generate_export_html()` to accept and render Ralph job data\n- 2f. Add Ralph section to `export.html` template (after features)\n- 2g. Add Ralph jobs to export modal tree in `project.html`\n- 2h. Add 5 tests for Ralph job export\n\n## Phase 3: Offline-First (Inline CDN Dependencies)\n\n**Priority: MEDIUM** — Inline Tailwind CSS, Mermaid.js, and Marked.js for true offline support.\n\n### Steps:\n- 3a. Create `vista/server/views/static/vendor/` with pre-downloaded minified dependencies\n- 3b. Create `InlineDependencyService` for reading vendor files with CDN fallback\n- 3c. Add `offline: bool = False` to `ExportRequest`\n- 3d. Modify `export.html` template with Jinja2 conditionals for inline vs CDN modes\n- 3e. Update `generate_export_html()` to pass inline deps when offline=True\n- 3f. Add offline toggle checkbox to export modal\n- 3g. Generate Tailwind CSS build script\n- 3h. Add 4 tests for offline mode\n\n## Phase 4: Template Customization (Theme Toggle + Table of Contents)\n\n**Priority: MEDIUM** — Light/dark theme toggle and TOC navigation.\n\n### Steps:\n- 4a. Add CSS custom properties for theming (dark/light)\n- 4b. Add theme toggle button with Mermaid re-render support\n- 4c. Add collapsible table of contents sidebar\n- 4d. Add `default_theme` to `ExportRequest`\n- 4e. Add 4 tests for theme and TOC\n\n## Phase 5: Export History\n\n**Priority: LOW** — Track previous exports with metadata.\n\n### Steps:\n- 5a. Create `ExportHistoryEntry` dataclass in `vista/server/models/export_history.py`\n- 5b. Create `ExportHistoryService` with JSON file storage at `~/.vista/data/export-history/`\n- 5c. Record exports in the export route handler\n- 5d. Add `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/history` endpoint\n- 5e. Show recent exports in export modal or project overview\n- 5f. Add 5 tests for export history\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":19,"newStart":13,"newLines":18,"lines":[" - **1e.** Updated export modal tree in `project.html` with indicator badges and per-content-type checkboxes"," - **1f.** Added 7 new tests (23 total, all passing)"," ","-## Phase 2: Specs and Implementation Plans from Ralph Jobs","+## DONE: Phase 2 — Specs and Implementation Plans from Ralph Jobs"," ","-**Priority: HIGH** — Export artifacts from standalone Ralph jobs (`.vista/ralph/` directories).","+All sub-tasks completed in iteration 2:"," ","-### Steps:","-- 2a. Add `get_exportable_ralph_jobs(project_path)` static method to ExportService — scans `.vista/ralph/` for jobs with exportable plans/progress/task/specs","-- 2b. Add `read_ralph_artifact(project_path, job_slug_dir, filename)` helper with path traversal prevention","-- 2c. Add `ExportRalphJobSelection` model and `ralph_jobs` field to `ExportRequest`","-- 2d. Add `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/ralph-jobs` endpoint","-- 2e. Extend `generate_export_html()` to accept and render Ralph job data","-- 2f. Add Ralph section to `export.html` template (after features)","-- 2g. Add Ralph jobs to export modal tree in `project.html`","-- 2h. Add 5 tests for Ralph job export","+- **2a.** Added `get_exportable_ralph_jobs()` — scans `.vista/ralph/` for jobs with task.md, IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md, or progress.txt. Reads job.json for metadata (mode, status).","+- **2b.** Added `read_ralph_artifact()` with whitelist (RALPH_EXPORTABLE_FILES) and path traversal prevention on job_slug.","+- **2c.** Added `ExportRalphJobSelection` model with slug, include_task, include_plan, include_progress toggles. Added `ralph_jobs` field to `ExportRequest`.","+- **2d.** Added `GET /api/projects/{id}/expor