{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ETD3UFRYx1ovCwtVVGVVTQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Phase 2 is complete. Here's a summary of what was built in this iteration:\n\n## Iteration 2 Summary — Phase 2: Ralph Job Artifacts Export\n\n### Files Changed (7 files, +584/-76 lines)\n\n**`vista/server/services/export_service.py`**\n- `get_exportable_ralph_jobs()` — scans `.vista/ralph/` for job dirs with task.md, IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md, or progress.txt. Reads `job.json` for metadata (mode, status).\n- `read_ralph_artifact()` — reads single artifact with whitelist enforcement (`RALPH_EXPORTABLE_FILES`) and path traversal prevention on job slug.\n- Extended `generate_export_html()` with `selected_ralph_jobs` parameter that collects Ralph artifacts with per-content toggles.\n\n**`vista/server/routes/export.py`**\n- `ExportRalphJobSelection` model (slug, include_task, include_plan, include_progress)\n- `ralph_jobs` field on `ExportRequest`\n- `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/ralph-jobs` endpoint\n\n**`vista/server/views/export.html`**\n- Ralph Jobs section after features with Task, Implementation Plan, and Progress Log subsections\n- Nav links for Ralph jobs with orange \"ralph:\" prefix\n- `renderAllMarkdown()` extended for ralph_tasks, ralph_plans, ralph_progress\n\n**`vista/server/views/project.html`**\n- Export modal fetches features + ralph-jobs in parallel\n- Ralph Jobs tree section with slug, mode, status badges and per-artifact checkboxes\n- `toggleRalphExpand()`, `collectSelectedRalphJobs()`, updated selectAll/download logic\n\n**`vista/tests/test_export_service.py`**\n- 12 new tests across `TestExportableRalphJobs` and `TestExportRalphRoutes` — **35 total, all passing**\n\n### Remaining Phases\n- Phase 3: Offline-First (inline CDN dependencies)\n- Phase 4: Theme Toggle + Table of Contents\n- Phase 5: Export History"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation