{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Pvqt4CwKndMGvAqu6FadtM","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→Plan improvements and V2 enhancements to the Share Docs (Documentation Export) feature.\n     2→\n     3→## Context\n     4→The share-docs feature was implemented in commit 10cb21e. It allows users to export Vista feature documentation (Mermaid architecture diagrams + domain requirements) as a self-contained HTML file from the Vista dashboard.\n     5→\n     6→## Current Implementation\n     7→1. ExportService (vista/server/services/export_service.py) - Scans .vista/features/ for exportable features, generates self-contained HTML\n     8→2. Export Routes (vista/server/routes/export.py) - GET /api/projects/{id}/export/features, POST /api/projects/{id}/export\n     9→3. Export Template (vista/server/views/export.html) - Standalone HTML with CDN Tailwind, Mermaid @11, Marked @15\n    10→4. Project Page Modal (vista/server/views/project.html) - Export Docs button + tree checklist modal\n    11→5. ProgressService.read_domain_requirements() - Reads domain-requirements.md for features\n    12→6. 16 tests (vista/tests/test_export_service.py)\n    13→\n    14→## What to Plan\n    15→Analyze the current share-docs implementation and create an implementation plan for V2 improvements:\n    16→1. Specs and Implementation Plans - Also export spec files and implementation plans from .vista/ralph/ jobs\n    17→2. Offline-First - Inline CDN dependencies (Tailwind/Mermaid/Marked) for true offline support\n    18→3. Export History - Track previous exports with metadata\n    19→4. Template Customization - Light/dark theme toggle, table of contents\n    20→5. Progress File Export - Include progress.txt and agents.md from feature planning\n    21→\n    22→## Codebase References\n    23→- ExportService: vista/server/services/export_service.py\n    24→- Export routes: vista/server/routes/export.py\n    25→- Export template: vista/server/views/export.html\n    26→- Project page modal: vista/server/views/project.html\n    27→- ProgressService: vista/server/services/progress_service.py\n    28→- Tests: vista/tests/test_export_service.py\n    29→- Previous plan: .vista/ralph/share-docs-plan/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\n    30→- Previous build: .vista/ralph/share-docs-build/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\n    31→\n    32→## Deliverable\n    33→Create an IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md with prioritized phases, each with file changes, new tests, and acceptance criteria."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6996de78-f515-44c4-bca3-90f28086b3f0","uuid":"e1922ed8-9b70-4518-b32b-288458acce0e","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista-expanded-visualization/.vista/ralph/share-docs-v2-build/task.md","content":"Plan improvements and V2 enhancements to the Share Docs (Documentation Export) feature.\n\n## Context\nThe share-docs feature was implemented in commit 10cb21e. It allows users to export Vista feature documentation (Mermaid architecture diagrams + domain requirements) as a self-contained HTML file from the Vista dashboard.\n\n## Current Implementation\n1. ExportService (vista/server/services/export_service.py) - Scans .vista/features/ for exportable features, generates self-contained HTML\n2. Export Routes (vista/server/routes/export.py) - GET /api/projects/{id}/export/features, POST /api/projects/{id}/export\n3. Export Template (vista/server/views/export.html) - Standalone HTML with CDN Tailwind, Mermaid @11, Marked @15\n4. Project Page Modal (vista/server/views/project.html) - Export Docs button + tree checklist modal\n5. ProgressService.read_domain_requirements() - Reads domain-requirements.md for features\n6. 16 tests (vista/tests/test_export_service.py)\n\n## What to Plan\nAnalyze the current share-docs implementation and create an implementation plan for V2 improvements:\n1. Specs and Implementation Plans - Also export spec files and implementation plans from .vista/ralph/ jobs\n2. Offline-First - Inline CDN dependencies (Tailwind/Mermaid/Marked) for true offline support\n3. Export History - Track previous exports with metadata\n4. Template Customization - Light/dark theme toggle, table of contents\n5. Progress File Export - Include progress.txt and agents.md from feature planning\n\n## Codebase References\n- ExportService: vista/server/services/export_service.py\n- Export routes: vista/server/routes/export.py\n- Export template: vista/server/views/export.html\n- Project page modal: vista/server/views/project.html\n- ProgressService: vista/server/services/progress_service.py\n- Tests: vista/tests/test_export_service.py\n- Previous plan: .vista/ralph/share-docs-plan/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\n- Previous build: .vista/ralph/share-docs-build/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\n\n## Deliverable\nCreate an IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md with prioritized phases, each with file changes, new tests, and acceptance criteria.","numLines":33,"startLine":1,"totalLines":33}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016QeBXHSsg7RnnSms81eyW2","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Implementation Plan: Share Docs V2 Build\n     2→\n     3→Based on the plan from `.vista/ralph/share-docs-v2-plan-6556ab4b-1235-428b-b9d2-da3c725732ac/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`.\n     4→\n     5→## DONE: Phase 1 — Progress File & Planning Artifacts Export\n     6→\n     7→All sub-tasks completed in iteration 1:\n     8→\n     9→- **1a.** Extended `get_exportable_features()` with `has_progress`, `has_agents_md`, `has_implementation_plan` flags\n    10→- **1b.** Extended `generate_export_html()` to collect and pass new content types (progress, agents, implementation_plan) with toggle support\n    11→- **1c.** Updated `ExportFeatureSelection` model with `include_requirements`, `include_progress`, `include_agents`, `include_implementation_plan` optional boolean fields (backward compatible, all default `True`)\n    12→- **1d.** Extended `export.html` template with Implementation Plan, Progress Log, and Agents sections. Renamed `renderAllRequirements()` to `renderAllMarkdown()`.\n    13→- **1e.** Updated export modal tree in `project.html` with indicator badges and per-content-type checkboxes\n    14→- **1f.** Added 7 new tests (23 total, all passing)\n    15→\n    16→## DONE: Phase 2 — Specs and Implementation Plans from Ralph Jobs\n    17→\n    18→All sub-tasks completed in iteration 2:\n    19→\n    20→- **2a.** Added `get_exportable_ralph_jobs()` — scans `.vista/ralph/` for jobs with task.md, IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md, or progress.txt. Reads job.json for metadata (mode, status).\n    21→- **2b.** Added `read_ralph_artifact()` with whitelist (RALPH_EXPORTABLE_FILES) and path traversal prevention on job_slug.\n    22→- **2c.** Added `ExportRalphJobSelection` model with slug, include_task, include_plan, include_progress toggles. Added `ralph_jobs` field to `ExportRequest`.\n    23→- **2d.** Added `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/ralph-jobs` endpoint.\n    24→- **2e.** Extended `generate_export_html()` with `selected_ralph_jobs` parameter. Populates ralph_tasks, ralph_plans, ralph_progress in export_data.\n    25→- **2f.** Added Ralph Jobs section to `export.html` with Task, Implementation Plan, and Progress Log subsections. Updated nav and renderAllMarkdown().\n    26→- **2g.** Updated export modal in `project.html` — parallel fetch of features + ralph-jobs, Ralph Jobs tree section with per-artifact checkboxes, collectSelectedRalphJobs(), updated selectAll/download logic.\n    27→- **2h.** Added 12 new tests (35 total, all passing) in TestExportableRalphJobs and TestExportRalphRoutes.\n    28→\n    29→## Phase 3: Offline-First (Inline CDN Dependencies)\n    30→\n    31→**Priority: MEDIUM** — Inline Tailwind CSS, Mermaid.js, and Marked.js for true offline support.\n    32→\n    33→### Steps:\n    34→- 3a. Create `vista/server/views/static/vendor/` with pre-downloaded minified dependencies\n    35→- 3b. Create `InlineDependencyService` for reading vendor files with CDN fallback\n    36→- 3c. Add `offline: bool = False` to `ExportRequest`\n    37→- 3d. Modify `export.html` template with Jinja2 conditionals for inline vs CDN modes\n    38→- 3e. Update `generate_export_html()` to pass inline deps when offline=True\n    39→- 3f. Add offline toggle checkbox to export modal\n    40→- 3g. Generate Tailwind CSS build script\n    41→- 3h. Add 4 tests for offline mode\n    42→\n    43→## Phase 4: Template Customization (Theme Toggle + Table of Contents)\n    44→\n    45→**Priority: MEDIUM** — Light/dark theme toggle and TOC navigation.\n    46→\n    47→### Steps:\n    48→- 4a. Add CSS custom properties for theming (dark/light)\n    49→- 4b. Add theme toggle button with Mermaid re-render support\n    50→- 4c. Add collapsible table of contents sidebar\n    51→- 4d. Add `default_theme` to `ExportRequest`\n    52→- 4e. Add 4 tests for theme and TOC\n    53→\n    54→## Phase 5: Export History\n    55→\n    56→**Priority: LOW** — Track previous exports with metadata.\n    57→\n    58→### Steps:\n    59→- 5a. Create `ExportHistoryEntry` dataclass in `vista/server/models/export_history.py`\n    60→- 5b. Create `ExportHistoryService` with JSON file storage at `~/.vista/data/export-history/`\n    61→- 5c. Record exports in the export route handler\n    62→- 5d. Add `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/history` endpoint\n    63→- 5e. Show recent exports in export modal or project overview\n    64→- 5f. Add 5 tests for export history\n    65→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6996de78-f515-44c4-bca3-90f28086b3f0","uuid":"8efbc251-291f-4353-b5d3-58bcd31e5310","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista-expanded-visualization/.vista/ralph/share-docs-v2-build/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md","content":"# Implementation Plan: Share Docs V2 Build\n\nBased on the plan from `.vista/ralph/share-docs-v2-plan-6556ab4b-1235-428b-b9d2-da3c725732ac/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`.\n\n## DONE: Phase 1 — Progress File & Planning Artifacts Export\n\nAll sub-tasks completed in iteration 1:\n\n- **1a.** Extended `get_exportable_features()` with `has_progress`, `has_agents_md`, `has_implementation_plan` flags\n- **1b.** Extended `generate_export_html()` to collect and pass new content types (progress, agents, implementation_plan) with toggle support\n- **1c.** Updated `ExportFeatureSelection` model with `include_requirements`, `include_progress`, `include_agents`, `include_implementation_plan` optional boolean fields (backward compatible, all default `True`)\n- **1d.** Extended `export.html` template with Implementation Plan, Progress Log, and Agents sections. Renamed `renderAllRequirements()` to `renderAllMarkdown()`.\n- **1e.** Updated export modal tree in `project.html` with indicator badges and per-content-type checkboxes\n- **1f.** Added 7 new tests (23 total, all passing)\n\n## DONE: Phase 2 — Specs and Implementation Plans from Ralph Jobs\n\nAll sub-tasks completed in iteration 2:\n\n- **2a.** Added `get_exportable_ralph_jobs()` — scans `.vista/ralph/` for jobs with task.md, IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md, or progress.txt. Reads job.json for metadata (mode, status).\n- **2b.** Added `read_ralph_artifact()` with whitelist (RALPH_EXPORTABLE_FILES) and path traversal prevention on job_slug.\n- **2c.** Added `ExportRalphJobSelection` model with slug, include_task, include_plan, include_progress toggles. Added `ralph_jobs` field to `ExportRequest`.\n- **2d.** Added `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/ralph-jobs` endpoint.\n- **2e.** Extended `generate_export_html()` with `selected_ralph_jobs` parameter. Populates ralph_tasks, ralph_plans, ralph_progress in export_data.\n- **2f.** Added Ralph Jobs section to `export.html` with Task, Implementation Plan, and Progress Log subsections. Updated nav and renderAllMarkdown().\n- **2g.** Updated export modal in `project.html` — parallel fetch of features + ralph-jobs, Ralph Jobs tree section with per-artifact checkboxes, collectSelectedRalphJobs(), updated selectAll/download logic.\n- **2h.** Added 12 new tests (35 total, all passing) in TestExportableRalphJobs and TestExportRalphRoutes.\n\n## Phase 3: Offline-First (Inline CDN Dependencies)\n\n**Priority: MEDIUM** — Inline Tailwind CSS, Mermaid.js, and Marked.js for true offline support.\n\n### Steps:\n- 3a. Create `vista/server/views/static/vendor/` with pre-downloaded minified dependencies\n- 3b. Create `InlineDependencyService` for reading vendor files with CDN fallback\n- 3c. Add `offline: bool = False` to `ExportRequest`\n- 3d. Modify `export.html` template with Jinja2 conditionals for inline vs CDN modes\n- 3e. Update `generate_export_html()` to pass inline deps when offline=True\n- 3f. Add offline toggle checkbox to export modal\n- 3g. Generate Tailwind CSS build script\n- 3h. Add 4 tests for offline mode\n\n## Phase 4: Template Customization (Theme Toggle + Table of Contents)\n\n**Priority: MEDIUM** — Light/dark theme toggle and TOC navigation.\n\n### Steps:\n- 4a. Add CSS custom properties for theming (dark/light)\n- 4b. Add theme toggle button with Mermaid re-render support\n- 4c. Add collapsible table of contents sidebar\n- 4d. Add `default_theme` to `ExportRequest`\n- 4e. Add 4 tests for theme and TOC\n\n## Phase 5: Export History\n\n**Priority: LOW** — Track previous exports with metadata.\n\n### Steps:\n- 5a. Create `ExportHistoryEntry` dataclass in `vista/server/models/export_history.py`\n- 5b. Create `ExportHistoryService` with JSON file storage at `~/.vista/data/export-history/`\n- 5c. Record exports in the export route handler\n- 5d. Add `GET /api/projects/{id}/export/history` endpoint\n- 5e. Show recent exports in export modal or project overview\n- 5f. Add 5 tests for export history\n","numLines":65,"startLine":1,"totalLines":65}}}
